        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-20T22:42:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just like other things, you choose the order cards&nbsp;are destroyed. If you destroy Self Destruct Sequence, then it destroys the countdown pile, not Omnitron, so he wouldn't get to play cards for the ones in the pile.</p><p>Haka still gets to draw cards from Dominion&nbsp;when the countdown pile is destroyed,&nbsp;since SDS says it destroys those cards and they are still considered Environment cards.</p>",
