      {
        "id": 77643,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-22T01:18:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, you could destroy the self destruct sequence first, and the pile would be destroyed by that card effect, or you could choose to destroy any number of the cards in the countdown pile before destroying the destruct sequence card, at which point you would play villain cards for them.</p><p>I just want to be clear in case you find a situation where you want Omnitron to play more cards with Terraforming.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:58:42.965Z",
