        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"TheJayMann\"]\n\nI think a similar issue came up years ago about Haka and Savage Mana.&nbsp; It was determined that using the power destroyed the already destroyed cards a second time (thus allowing Ammo Drop to benifit, along with other cards), but if Savage Mana were destroyed, the cards underneath were not destroyed, but sent (discarded?) to their appropriate trashes.&nbsp; If that is the case, I would assume that Self Destruct Sequence would follow as well.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYeah, If the conditions on SDS are met to destroy the cards, then they are destroyed, but if it&#39;s destroyed by other means it does make sense they&#39;d just be discarded.\n",
